{"id": "16-2431-2-2", "zh": "以 kha 结尾的词根", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2432-2-4", "zh": "lakkha：表示“看见”与“标记”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2432-5-7", "zh": "“看见”就是观看。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2432-8-10", "zh": "“标记”就是印记。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2432-11-14", "zh": "lakkheti、lakkhayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2432-15-18", "zh": "sallakkheti、sallakkhayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2432-19-25", "zh": "用箭射靶（lakkhaṃ vijjhati usunā），作标记（lakkhaṃ karoti）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2433-2-10", "zh": "恒河的沙子也许会耗尽，大海的水也许会耗尽；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2434-2-10", "zh": "大地的泥土也许会耗尽，我的智慧却无法计量。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-2435-2-3", "zh": "劫的特征（kappalakkhaṇaṃ）。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "16-2435-4-5", "zh": "相牛术（golakkhaṇaṃ）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2435-6-7", "zh": "相女术（itthilakkhaṇaṃ）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2435-8-10", "zh": "诸法的特相（dhammānaṃ lakkhaṇaṃ）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2435-11-12", "zh": "审察（sallakkhanā）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2435-13-14", "zh": "观察（upalakkhanā）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2435-15-16", "zh": "反复观察（paccupalakkhanā）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2435-17-27", "zh": "lakkha 词根加上 yu 词缀、前面带 saṃ 等前缀时，所成词形中的 na 音是齿音。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2436-2-4", "zh": "bhakkha：表示“吃”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2436-5-8", "zh": "bhakkheti、bhakkhayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2436-9-12", "zh": "我们得到了食物。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2436-13-15", "zh": "卑劣的野兽吞食。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2436-16-26", "zh": "但在 bhū 等动词类中，词形是“bhakkhati”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2437-2-4", "zh": "nakkha：表示“连结”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2437-5-8", "zh": "nakkheti、nakkhayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2438-2-4", "zh": "makkha：表示“涂抹”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2438-5-8", "zh": "makkheti、makkhayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2438-9-12", "zh": "makkho、makkhī。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2438-13-23", "zh": "其中，**覆**（makkho）是指：把别人所做的恩德涂抹掉、碾碎，所以叫做“覆”，也就是抹杀恩德。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2438-24-40", "zh": "但在“makkhaṃ asahamāno”（不能忍受轻蔑）这句话中，别人加在自己身上的轻视被称为**覆**。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-2439-2-4", "zh": "yakkha：表示“供养”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2439-5-8", "zh": "yakkheti、yakkhayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2439-9-10", "zh": "yakkho。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2439-11-15", "zh": "**夜叉**（yakkha）是指有大威力的有情。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2439-16-38", "zh": "例如在“我问你，大夜叉，一切众生的主宰”这句话中，天王帝释就被称为“夜叉”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2439-39-45", "zh": "或者，**夜叉**是指投生在夜叉类中的有情。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2439-46-56", "zh": "或者，一切有情都被称为“夜叉”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2439-57-70", "zh": "因为在“他们宣说最高的夜叉清净”这句话中，yakkha 一词指的是有情。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2439-71-90", "zh": "所以，夜叉、有情、天神、帝释、漏尽者都叫做夜叉；因为有大威力，受到归依他们的人们用各种资具和各种供品来供养，所以叫做夜叉。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2440-2-11", "zh": "有情、天神、帝释、漏尽者和罗刹——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2441-2-8", "zh": "yakkha 一词用于这五种意义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2442-2-5", "zh": "lakkha：表示“审视”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2442-6-9", "zh": "lakkheti、lakkhayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2442-10-13", "zh": "用箭射靶。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2443-2-4", "zh": "mokkha：表示“放出”。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "16-2443-5-8", "zh": "mokkheti、mokkhayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2444-2-4", "zh": "rukkha：表示“粗恶”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2444-5-7", "zh": "“粗恶”就是粗暴的性质。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2444-8-11", "zh": "rukkheti、rukkhayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2444-12-22", "zh": "在复合词中有“rukkhakeso（头发粗硬的）”“atirukkhavacano（说话极其粗恶的）”等词形。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2444-23-36", "zh": "这里，“这个沙门是恶人，说话极其粗恶”是圣典中的例证。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2444-37-42", "zh": "其中，**说话极其粗恶**（atirukkhavāco）的意思是言语极其粗暴。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2445-2-4", "zh": "以 kha 结尾的词根的词形。", "confidence": 85}
